   "widgets_values": [
    "## E18b: repair by latent comp (`ReplaceVideoLatentFrames`)\n\n**There is no repaint node** - `SetLatentNoiseMask` fails on an audio latent (the sampler's mask path is\nhard-wired for `[B,1,H,W]` images, E18) and `LatentInpaintTTM` is a video-method model patch that still needs\na mask. **This is the official, mask-free equivalent:** `ReplaceVideoLatentFrames` splices a range of *frames*\nfrom one latent into another - and an audio latent's frames are its time axis (25 per second, E18).\n\n**The repair:** take **A** = the industrial take with **55-61 s silenced** (`input/ace_iron_gap.flac`), take\n**B** = a *second render of the same song* (same model, style, lyric; different seed - the studio \"comp\"), trim\nB to the damaged span (`TrimAudioDuration`, 55 s + 6 s), encode both latents, splice B's 150 frames into A at\nindex **1375**, decode, save.\n\n**What to check:** is the deleted span restored (words back), does the join hold, and is the rest of A intact?\nCaveat to measure: A's untouched frames are VAE round-tripped here (there is no mask to protect them), which is\nexactly why the waveform comp - decoding B and crossfading it into A's audio - remains the higher-fidelity\nalternative.\n"
   ],
   "properties": {},
   "order": 0
  }
